abstract: >-
  Artifacts for a paper on repeat-controlled evaluation of an interactive
  reasoning agent on ARC-AGI-3: every pushed Kaggle notebook, the harness
  patch, the analysis scripts that regenerate every number in the paper,
  per-game tables, the experiment registry, and the manuscript. The linked
  competition submission is 57174905 (public score 30.21).
